      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This suggestion is useful even if we are not using OSC eye tracking.\n\nPseudo eye tracking currently does not allow Animator to know where the avatar's gaze is looking. Therefore, it is not possible to do the following\n\n- Adding a gimmick to match the avatar's gaze\n\n- Reproducing custom gaze gimmicks on Animator using only parameters",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
